  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pypa/virtualenv/zipball/21.15.14",
  "body": "<a name=\"release-21-15-14-fixed\"></a>\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- An explicit `--app-data` path that exists but is not a directory is now a usage error. When `VIRTUALENV_OVERRIDE_APP_DATA` or the default cache names such a path, writable runs warn and use temporary app-data instead of failing while seeding, and a file at the default cache location keeps its permissions ([#3773](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3773)) by @qianeric-backup and @gaborbernat.\n- `--upgrade-embed-wheels` with read-only or temporary app-data now exits with status 1 after one error that asks for a writable `--app-data` folder, instead of logging `could not upgrade` with an empty reason for every package and Python version ([#3774](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3774)) by @qianeric-backup and @gaborbernat.\n\n### New Contributors\n\n- @qianeric-backup made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3773\n\n[🐍 PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/virtualenv/21.15.14/)\n\n[📜 Full Changelog](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.15.13...21.15.14)\n",
